{"id":"n23600-1-7","stage":2,"title":"공중전화 · 公用电话","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23600-1-7-1","ko":"이 공중전화에는 카드를 쓸 수 없나요?","zh":"这台公用电话不能用卡吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공중전화에는","meaning":"公用电话","explanation":"공중전화：公用电话；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"공중전화","audio":"/audio/8b803e2ff9fb56e406ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23600","senseId":"1","lemma":"공중전화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"카드를","meaning":"银行卡，储蓄卡，信用卡","explanation":"카드：银行卡，储蓄卡，信用卡；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"카드","audio":"/audio/62b41b5aaec6fef4bd83.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71472","senseId":"7","lemma":"카드","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쓸","meaning":"用，使用","explanation":"쓰다：用，使用；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없나요?","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"8b803e2ff9fb56e4","term":"공중전화","zh":"公用电话","audio":"/audio/8b803e2ff9fb56e406ee.mp3","entryId":"23600","defi